# sink.part -- A through hole with a countersink that ends below the top face
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

profile r along z 0 0 0 20 0 0 20 10 0 0 10 0
extrude blk from 0 to 5 r
circle c along z 10 5 6
circle c8 along z 10 5 8
extrude hole from -1 to 6 c
extrude cs from 5 to 3.5 c8 draft 45
cut u blk hole cs
